screen 1280 800 dpi 1.0
# U42: the mod browser (ConfigModBrowser.OpenAddModPopup) from the custom mod block's "Add Mod"
# (the popup coordinates are for 1280x800; g_mod_browser_1920x1080 is the same script for the
# other resolution). A search no label matches ("zqzq") puts "Custom Modifiers" at the top of
# column 1 (U41's c_custom). The popup collects every supported tree/item mod line (sorted by
# sortKey/template/text). Each search is typed before the popup's first frame: the unfiltered
# list's numeric templates show whichever line PoB's per-process `pairs` order met first
# (mod_browser.rs ORDER), the digit-free rows of these searches do not depend on it.
# * search "cannot be stunned" (fuzzyScore ranks: substring, all words), hover the "?" button
#   (its wrapped help tooltip), double-click row 2 (OnSelClick -> save.onClick: the line
#   appended to the block text, UpdateCustomModsControls, AddUndoState, BuildModList);
# * reopen, search "unaffected by", single-click row 1, move off the list, press "Add";
# * reopen, a search nothing matches ("No matching modifiers found": Add disabled), Cancel.
#! u42-expect-config title="Default" enabled="true"
fixture userdir=../../fixtures/user1
frames 2
move 400 91
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
press RETURN
frames 3
key-down CTRL
press 5
key-up CTRL
frames 3
move 500 75
click LEFTBUTTON
type "zqzq"
frames 3
